# Stage 4d (RC_JOBS=rc.jobs.cell4d; boot-args r1_md_iffake=1 r1_md_budget_mb=1, NOWIFI): 1.25 MB of UDP into the fake bearer; the budget stops it at ~1 MB.
/redwood/bin/celld &
/redwood/bin/cell_check wait 45 fake 1 state data_up 10 wait 3 ifstat udp 192.0.2.9 9 1250 1000 2000 wait 3 state budget 10 dump ifstat wait 3 usage
